    "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:10:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-24T12:10:27Z",
    "body": "I suppose we could have an \"hyperlink element\" concept and make HTML `a` and `area` elements use that. If we need a lot of type-specific branching that might get cumbersome though.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
