    "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:23Z",
    "body": "I am thinking of `Hyperlink element` definition as below:\n\nAn element is a `Hyperlink element` if it follows the [HTML processing model](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#following-hyperlinks-2) and its specification explicitly declares that it supports the `Hyperlink element` concept.\n\n`a` and `area` are Hyperlink elements",
